    {
      "id": "p0047-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Sales-wise, Undertale was a clear success. Through word of mouth, the game sold over 500,000 copies in its first three months. That number has since reached into the millions - a level usually only achieved by industry titans like Nintendo and Sony.",
        "raw": "Sales-wise, Undertale was a clear success. Through word of mouth, the game\nsold over 500,000 copies in its first three months. That number has since\nreached into the millions - a level usually only achieved by industry titans like\nNintendo and Sony.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09946016,
          0.11297143,
          0.6960895,
          0.17925
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09492314,
          0.11225714,
          0.707665,
          0.18032143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          3,
          4,
          5,
          6
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "销量上，它无疑取得了成功。靠玩家口口相传，前三个月就售出超过50万份；后来更达到数百万份，通常只有任天堂、索尼这样的业界巨头才做得到。",
        "status": "draft",
