      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Undertale also achieved critical success - the game received acclaim from game critics, reviewers, and industry veterans alike. News of Undertale's success even reached mainstream outlets, which led to further recognition outside gaming circles.",
        "raw": "Undertale also achieved critical success - the game received acclaim from game\ncritics, reviewers, and industry veterans alike. News of Undertale's success\neven reached mainstream outlets, which led to further recognition outside\ngaming circles.",
