    {
      "id": "p0047-b009",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "Nominated for Best RPG (THE GAME AWARDS, 2015) Runner-up for Best Indie (GLOBAL GAME AWARDS, 2015) Nominated for Outstanding Achievement in Game Direction (19TH ANNUAL D.l.C.E. AWAROS, 2016) Nominated for Best Story (12TH BRITJSH ACADEMY GAMES AWARDS, 2016) Winner of Audience Award (INDEPENDENT GAMES FESTIVAL AWARDS, 2016) Winner of Best Original Role Playing Game (NAVGTR AWARDS)",
        "raw": "Nominated for Best RPG (THE GAME AWARDS, 2015)\nRunner-up for Best Indie (GLOBAL GAME AWARDS, 2015)\nNominated for Outstanding Achievement in Game Direction\n(19TH ANNUAL D.l.C.E. AWAROS, 2016)\nNominated for Best Story (12TH BRITJSH ACADEMY GAMES AWARDS, 2016)\nWinner of Audience Award (INDEPENDENT GAMES FESTIVAL AWARDS, 2016)\nWinner of Best Original Role Playing Game (NAVGTR AWARDS)",
