    {
      "id": "p0047-b010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Undertale was also a hit with players. A massive fan following grew overnight. Undertale costumes were suddenly everywhere. Undertale concerts with full symphony orchestras were held around the world. Countless Undertale fan games and Undertale-inspired games were shared online. Even sketchy bootleg companies began pumping out every type of poor quality Undertale merchandise imaginable.",
